  diseaseId: ibs
  diseaseName: "IBS (Huzursuz Ba\u011F\u0131rsak Sendromu)"
  generalInfo: "IBS, ba\u011F\u0131rsak hareketlerinde d\xFCzensizlik ve kar\u0131n
    rahats\u0131zl\u0131\u011F\u0131 ile seyreden fonksiyonel bir sindirim sistemi
    hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131,
    \u015Fi\u015Fkinlik ve d\u0131\u015Fk\u0131lama de\u011Fi\u015Fiklikleri g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 var olmas\u0131, \u015Fi\u015Fkinlik
    hissi var olmas\u0131, ishal mevcut olmas\u0131 ve stresle yak\u0131nmalar\u0131n
    artmas\u0131 IBS hastalar\u0131nda s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131
    hastalarda d\u0131\u015Fk\u0131lama sonras\u0131 k\u0131smi rahatlama olabilir."
